\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.6}{\ignorespaces The dielectric constant and dissipation factor for (a) (Nb$_{2}$O$_{5}$)$_{1-x}$(GeO$_{2}$)$_{x}$ and (b) (Ta$_{2}$O$_{5}$)$_{1-x}$(SnO$_{2}$)$_{x}$ plotted as a function of composition. The dielectric constant of (Nb$_{2}$O$_{5}$)$_{1-x}$(GeO$_{2}$)$_{x}$ shows a mostly linear dependence in $\varepsilon _{r}$ with composition, whereas (Ta$_{2}$O$_{5}$)$_{1-x}$(SnO$_{2}$)$_{x}$ shows a nondispersive and highly dispersive region.\relax }}{101}}
